      "html": "<p>Asked what a <strong>Care Inspectorate grade</strong> means? Here is the plain answer. Each key question gets a grade from 1 to 6. 6 is the highest.</p><p>The Care Inspectorate sets the exact wording and updates it. Check its latest words. This page is general information, not regulatory advice.</p>"
